<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "A conference can run in a browser tab of its own, with the whole window to itself. Open the summary next to Call in the channel toolbar and choose Open in a tab. It is the same conference either way — the chat keeps its Group Call window for when you would rather not leave the page."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_close}>{dgettext("help_p2p", "Closing the tab is not leaving")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_p2p",
    "The room decides who is in the call, not the tab. Closing the tab starts the reconnection window rather than ending your part, and opening the same address again puts you back where you were. Only Leave, which asks first, is final. The tab always shows a way back to the chat along its bottom edge: there is no conversation inside a call."
  )}
</p>

<p>
  {dgettext("help_p2p", "See also:")}
  <.help_link topic="feature-channel-conference">
    {dgettext("help_p2p", "Channel Conference")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-conference-share">
    {dgettext("help_p2p", "Sharing a Conference Link")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
